{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8a775eb349919e40abc9a5cfab45d14d1c651d874762b89195d8f6a8226c1601", "ja": "（映画『三姉妹カフェ』が好評なため、\n舞台挨拶のイベントが続いている。今日は杏奈だ）", "zh": "（由于电影《三姊妹咖啡厅》大获好评，\n接连不断有电影见面会的活动。而今天是由杏奈出席。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1001_p", "source_sha256": "930853320ca0d003d20b15c8b1c3bb111788c6197fa3033d080a00097738c493", "ja": "杏奈、おつかれさま。今日もたくさん\nファンレターが届いてたな。もう読んだのか？", "zh": "杏奈，辛苦了。今天也收到不少\n粉丝信对吧，你已经看过了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1002_024ann", "source_sha256": "24bc3fbc7e95b970fa8912e3e93b403b5e76e906e19ca4bdbd3f27a67d760042", "ja": "ん……読んだ、けど……。", "zh": "嗯……看是看了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1003_p", "source_sha256": "13963fb153d5a737ec350a6642a2a69ee3429d71f3b31f4f3336c8ede9ec6d2f", "ja": "杏奈？\nもしかして、何か変なことが書いてあったのか？", "zh": "杏奈？\n难道里面有什么奇怪的内容吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "c0e8c1ac5fb32bb718e974bac32012a06d858683bfe418e2ae5a94b7a96f8703", "ja": "ううん……。お手紙……三奈は、思いやりがあって\nお菓子もつくれて、すごいって……ほめられた……。", "zh": "不是……信里写道……三奈很体贴人，\n还会做甜点，很厉害……都是称赞的内容……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1005_p", "source_sha256": "2e07b558596126c33337c4b01a12b2cb432f53663892c83880d3e240dae10c4a", "ja": "よかったじゃないか！　……ん？\nそれなのに、杏奈は落ち込んでるのか？", "zh": "这不是很好吗！\n……嗯？那为什么杏奈会垂头丧气的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1006_024ann", "source_sha256": "a9e56d8ab56ea15095afb87259c7725b26794a3d7869d8fadee80dddf9c850c8", "ja": "思いやりがあって、お菓子も料理もつくれるのは……\n三奈で、杏奈じゃない……です。", "zh": "因为啊，体贴、厨艺又好的人……\n是三奈，不是杏奈……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "d2f14f06551877fb982f9541b54b0d2decb123386e7bab59fd5408b5f9fd8990", "ja": "ちょっと、困った……。\n杏奈……三奈みたいって、思われてる……。", "zh": "杏奈有点伤脑筋……\n自己……是不是被认为和三奈一样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "b8c09c4517f287ce515c168e34a82a76b18f5b18f393b80e33e9b2a4a2f653a9", "ja": "杏奈、三奈みたいに、いろいろできないから……。\n本当のこと知ったら、みんなショック……かも。", "zh": "但杏奈不像三奈会这么多事情……\n大家要是知道了真相，可能会很受伤……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1009_p", "source_sha256": "15388c7355ad2c116428919d0768adf1105395277a6a63af4dae147581f1517b", "ja": "そんなことないと思う。\n杏奈と三奈は、似てると思うよ。", "zh": "没有这回事。\n我觉得杏奈和三奈很相似喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "571099752e6ad8ea4822cdfc2f92147237da4a3e38b252d13c499a6ff728ee3e", "ja": "え……。杏奈と……三奈が……？", "zh": "咦……杏奈和……三奈相似……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1011_p", "source_sha256": "69428f4dc5f80f9245b337a3631220f381e88e5d9d846c3eec28051112f3ffbf", "ja": "もちろん。杏奈も三奈と同じように、日々のレッスンで\nできることがすこしずつ増えていってるだろ？", "zh": "没有错，杏奈也跟三奈一样，每天不断上课练习，\n一点一滴在学会新的事物不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "6f99c42171546f1de359230451cb01969520273af4bdfd15dd457ae01c5c24ee", "ja": "うん……ちょっとずつ、だけど……。\n増えてる、かも……です。", "zh": "嗯……虽然只是慢慢的……\n但好像真的有在……成长。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1013_024ann", "source_sha256": "651ed5ee3ba7e493b4a0e9edf26387cf658311c4d58780e179686236705684e4", "ja": "シフォンケーキと、ふわとろオムライス……\n杏奈も練習して、作れるようになった……。", "zh": "戚风蛋糕和柔软滑嫩的蛋包饭……\n杏奈也努力学会怎么做了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1014_p", "source_sha256": "2a31498b4dede8d5a0fee063f5cf8b9c31adfe96b14e93a2298016a504ec674f", "ja": "そうだな。だからファンの人が手紙に書いてくれた事は\n間違いじゃない。ちゃんと、杏奈のことだよ。", "zh": "对啊，所以粉丝在信里写的并没有错，\n那些确实都是在说杏奈喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "9f6a2e64c7f15a9304f56384958bba2a3464bfc4dd22c1ce300a74518706dbe7", "ja": "{$P$}さん……ありがとう……♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生……谢谢你……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "0428644ae910dbe280ac9cd043eb75a06294f741fd969128f0d0c1c86d69da40", "ja": "杏奈、三奈よりいろいろできないけど……\nみんな、杏奈のこと応援してくれるかな……？", "zh": "杏奈不像三奈会这么多事情……\n大家会愿意声援杏奈吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b92bbc7b51b52d78844d749e5e9636a84058831c9e825124a91e93b01860011a", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ。これから色んな経験をして、\n少しずつ、出来る事を増やしていこうな！", "zh": "嗯，这是当然。今后就多去尝试不同的事，\n一点一滴地让自己成长下去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "7496bc7ab3704de028ec7d3e1a5e95c6c75dde7675eb5ad257d0cf7ed63ff6fe", "ja": "ん……杏奈、がんばる……。\n{$P$}さんがいれば、大丈夫……。", "zh": "嗯……杏奈会加油的……\n只要有{$P$}先生在，就没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_024ann0083_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_024ann0083_1019_024ann", "source_sha256": "1c0783b26a8844cd8f6c5fbc6e097159352b017dee61abf91117e8a682fcddcd", "ja": "これからも……よろしく、です……♪", "zh": "今后……也请多多指教……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
